#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:0
msgid ""
"Reference for advanced disk setup options in the Ubuntu Desktop installer, "
"including LVM, ZFS and passphrase encryption with ZFS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:7
msgid "Topics: Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:11
msgid "Advanced disk setup features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:13
msgid ""
"When installing Ubuntu Desktop, the installer offers several disk setup "
"options. The recommended ones are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:15
msgid "No encryption"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:16
msgid "Use regular disk partitioning with no extra features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:18
msgid "Encrypt with a passphrase"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:19
msgid ""
"Enable Logical Volume Management (LVM) with disk encryption. This is the "
"recommended option to encrypt your data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:21
msgid "Use hardware-backed disk encryption"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:22
msgid ""
"This is a new encryption method that can unlock your disk automatically "
"without a password. For details, see {ref}`hardware-backed-disk-encryption`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:24
msgid "The following advanced features are available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:26
msgid "Use LVM without encryption"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:27
msgid ""
"LVM makes it easier to create and manage partitions after the installation. "
"For details, see {external:ref}`about-lvm`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:29
msgid "Use ZFS without encryption"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:30
msgid ""
"This advanced file system allows you to create pooled storage volumes that "
"span multiple drives. It supports snapshots and data repair features. It is "
"a powerful option for advanced users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:32
msgid "Encrypt with a passphrase using ZFS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/advanced-disk-setup-features.md:33
msgid "Use ZFS and enable its data encryption feature."
msgstr ""
